  "steps": [
    "Preheat the oven to 200ºC (fan 180ºC/gas mark 6).",
    "Put the chicken, spices, sweetener and ground almonds in an ovenproof dish and mix to ensure the chicken is coated evenly in the spices and almonds. Scatter over the sliced onion, pour over the stock and bake in the preheated oven for 40 minutes.",
    "Remove from the oven and carefully stir in the cream cheese.",
    "Sprinkle the flaked almonds over the top and pop back in the oven for another 5 minutes, until the almonds have started to become golden.",
    "Remove from the oven and leave to stand for 5 minutes."
